{"type":"META","ticket":2248,"id":"META"}||{"title":"5002","tags":["连接器","测试点/测试环"],"source":"8a4bfbbc42f7488ca8a733c06de23511|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","images":["https://alimg.szlcsc.com/upload/public/product/middle/20230108/C7FB181AEBDB2186DCA6311DD7895064.jpg"],"attributes":{"LCSC Part Name":"通孔安装测试点，颜色标识","Supplier Part":"C238123","Manufacturer":"Keystone","Manufacturer Part":"5002","Supplier Footprint":"-","JLCPCB Part Class":"Extended Part","Datasheet":"https://item.szlcsc.com/datasheet/5002/237371.html","Supplier":"LCSC","Add into BOM":"yes","Convert to PCB":"yes","Symbol":"3bdbe6c23ab51c09","Designator":"U?","Footprint":"df6f37cd39df9dd9","3D Model":"dcb96c438af54a9abf65385e9247a593|0819f05c4eef4c71ace90d822a990e87","3D Model Title":"TEST-TH_D2.54-H4.6-P1.39","3D Model Transform":"100,99.944,0,0,0,0,-0.197,0,-118.11","Connector Type":"插针型(穿板)","Plastic Color":"白色","Board Space (Diameter φ/ Length x Width)":"2.5mm","Name":"={Manufacturer Part}","Description":"特性：彩色标记,便于观察和快速识别。是PC测试点终端的经济选择。卡扣式安装,为波峰焊提供可靠固定。线环设计,确保安全防滑测试。节省空间,有超薄和低轮廓设计。高轮廓设计,适用于难以触及的应用。适用于0.062(1.57)和0.093(2.36)PC板的高密度封装。可有效替代绕线柱和绕线架。能牢固夹住J型钩、EZ型钩、抓取器、鳄鱼夹、测试头或探针。高温尼龙底座,非常适合回流焊。非常适合可靠的生产测试和现场服务故障排除","SymbolName":"{\"name\":\"5002\",\"uuid\":\"3bdbe6c23ab51c09\",\"source\":\"\"}","FootprintName":"{\"name\":\"TEST-TH_BD2.54-P1.39\",\"uuid\":\"df6f37cd39df9dd9\",\"source\":\"\"}"}}|
